{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的感受描写明显不如 Y 细腻，尤其缺少 Y 对音乐细节、情绪转折和心理反应之间具体对应的刻画。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的双栏结构让我可以先扫完整叙述，再挑右侧感受词，尤其在 20 至 30 秒的短段落里更容易及时获得信息；完整句子也更清楚地交代了人物的动机、犹豫和选择。Y 用【】突出重点，并让感受随乐句出现，情绪变化更细腻，音乐对应也更具体，但部分短段落的信息切换过密，容易顾得上细节却抓不住整体。综合普通观众的实际观看体验，我更愿意选 X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "faaffbc2-0ddb-4647-899d-a25a84294ba4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T075445351187Z", "elapsed_seconds": 87.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:56:12.389576+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5bf5c2ff883f41e41059f217948378b416b6040560d7b5ffae473cd8e093916a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":